Main Hoon Saath Tere guitar chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood movie Shaadi Me Zaroor Aana sung by Arijit Singh.

Strumming Pattern: DUU DUU DDU

[A]Aasman [D]sitaron se [A]chalakne laga

Chaand sa [D]tu jo mujhmein [A]chamakne laga [Bm][A]

[Bm]Rahoon tere [D]yoon paas [A] main

[D]Banoon tera [A]ehsas main

[E]Yaar [A]jee loon aa teri [D]har saans [A]mein

[A]Shaam sa tu [D]dhalta

Tu [A]subah sa [D]nikalta

Tere saaye mein chalta

Main [F#m]hoon saath tere [E]

Main [A]hoon saath tere [D]

[A]Hai yehi [D]irada

[A]Tujhe chaahun khud se [D]zyada

[Bm]Dil se hai yeh [D]vaada

Main hoon saath [F#m] tere [E]

[A]Main hoon saath [D] tere

Rest are same as above
